SNAPBOOTH BY JAMES STUDIO — Complete Feature Summary

Below is the complete list of features and enhancements built into the SnapBooth web application.

📸 1. Camera & Capture Engine

Configurable Timer Duration: Toggle between 3S, 5S, or 10S countdown timers prior to starting photo capture sequences or retaking single shots.



Selfie Mirror Toggle: Switch between MIRROR: ON (natural selfie view) and MIRROR: OFF (true camera orientation).

Lens Switching: Toggle between front (user) and rear (environment) camera lenses on mobile devices.

True Aspect Ratio Capture: Captures photos directly from your camera's native video stream dimensions (videoWidth & videoHeight), completely eliminating stretched or squished faces.

Upload / Demo Fallback Mode: Automatic fallback allowing users to upload photo files directly if webcam permissions are denied or unavailable.

📐 2. Aspect Ratios & Layout Geometries

4 Photo Aspect Ratios:

PORTRAIT (3:4) — Classic studio portrait frame.

LANDSCAPE (4:3) — Horizontal widescreen layout.

SQUARE (1:1) — Grid style formatting.

MOBILE (9:16) — Tailored 1080x1920 wallpaper & story format for mobile screens.

Shot Selection First: Choose 2, 3, 4, or 6 shots before entering the camera feed.

Compatible Layout Options:

2 Shots: Vertical Strip, Dual Horizontal, Polaroid Duo.

3 Shots: Classic Strip, Trio Polaroid, Hero Frame (1 Large + 2 Small).

4 Shots: K-Style 4-Cut Grid (2x2), Vertical Strip, Black Film Strip, Polaroid Quad.

6 Shots: 3x2 Deluxe Grid, 2x3 Tall Collage, 6-Shot Mega Strip.

Photo Corner Styles: Toggle between SHARP cut edges and ROUNDED smooth photo corners.

🎨 3. Design Studio & Touch Stickers & Digital Touch Pen 

Mouse & Touch Stretch Stickers: Click/touch and drag the blue bottom-right corner handle on any sticker to stretch or scale it smoothly in real time.

Individual Sticker Management: Each placed sticker has a top-right × delete badge for quick removal.

Digital Touch Pen & Freehand Drawing Layer: allowing users to draw doodles, write autographs, draw hearts, or write handwritten notes over the frame.

Preset Studio Themes: One-click styling presets (Classic, Minimal, Haru Blue, Black Film, Pastel Pink, Vintage, Party Y2K, Editorial).

Color Customizer: Full RGB color picker alongside quick-select preset swatches for strip background colors.

Typography & Text Controls:

Main Title (Default: SNAPBOOTH 2026)

Subtitle / Event Name (Default: SNAPBOOTHBYJAMES)

Automatic Date Stamp (e.g., 2026.09.19)

Font Styles: Monospace, Space Grotesk, Editorial Serif, and Handwritten.

🔄 4. Photo Review & Reordering

Photo Position Swap: Reorder captured photos in Step 03 using < and > position shift arrows.

Single Frame Retake: Re-shoot any individual photo frame without resetting the rest of your captured shots.

Custom In-App Reset Modal: Custom studio modal popup (#resetModal) for starting over, bypassing native browser confirm() restrictions.

📲 5. High-Res Export & Mobile Share Engine

300 DPI Canvas Rendering: Generates clean, high-resolution JPG and PNG print files without browser UI artifacts.

Blob-Based Downloads: Native blob object URLs ensure reliable file downloads across mobile Safari, Android Chrome, and sandboxed iframe environments.

Mobile Touch & Hold Saving (SAVE / QR):

Opens a modal preview allowing mobile users to Press & Hold (Long-Press) the rendered photo strip to tap "Add to Photos" or "Save Image".

"OPEN FULL IMAGE" button launches a dedicated full-screen tab for tap-and-hold saving.

Scannable QR code generator linking to the studio URL for desktop-to-mobile session transfers.

📱 6. Mobile & Touch Optimizations

Touch Event Isolation: Built with PointerEvent tracking (setPointerCapture), enabling smooth drag-and-stretch sticker adjustments on touchscreens without scrolling the browser page.

Responsive Layout: Fluid widths, touch target padding (min 44px), and horizontal scrollable control tabs for small mobile screens.
